    "analysis": {
      "investment_rationale": [
        {
          "institution": "Haatch",
          "speaker": "Fred Soneya",
          "speaker_role": "联合创始人兼普通合伙人",
          "rationale": "Haatch 认为 AI 的最大赢家将属于在高风险、通用工具不足的市场中深耕的公司，私募资本法律工作正是典型例子；Perry AI 不仅审查文件，还构建基金所有承诺的活记忆并据此行动，早期客户结果出色。",
          "quote": "The biggest wins in AI will go to companies that go deep in markets where the stakes are high and generalist tools fall short. Private capital legal work is a textbook example. Shashwat and Vaneesa have spent nearly three decades between them doing this work, and it shows in the product: Perry AI doesn’t just review documents, it builds a living memory of every commitment a fund has made and acts on it. The early customer results are exceptional, and we’re delighted to lead this round as Perry takes its platform to the next level",
          "evidence_refs": [
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-11faac8c8448faa7",
              "quote": "The biggest wins in AI will go to companies that go deep in markets where the stakes are high and generalist tools fall short. Private capital legal work is a textbook example. Shashwat and Vaneesa have spent nearly three decades between them doing this work, and it shows in the product: Perry AI doesn’t just review documents, it builds a living memory of every commitment a fund has made and acts on it. The early customer results are exceptional, and we’re delighted to lead this round as Perry takes its platform to the next level",
              "source_content_hash": "1e19a2ea10bf8d222f91168b5a488ed56674641f36bc810745f560f43f2cd249",
              "quote_hash": "b19f3942d395b37eacaf1bb7a6fc8c7e1b8adfa76749c430caefaf7af2134bf0"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "capital_judgment": "资本押注的核心变量是 Perry AI 能否将“基金级法律记忆”这一垂直深度产品转化为跨司法辖区的可复制采用，尤其是在美国与亚洲市场。当前融资依赖的已验证信号包括：平台已服务管理超 15 亿美元资产的基金、覆盖超 1000 家投资组合公司，以及客户自报的 90% 效率提升和交易签署时间从 84 天降至 13 天。这些均为公司自述数据，未经独立验证；本轮未披露估值，且金额较小，判断边界在于早期客户结果能否在陌生法律市场复现。",
